&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 16px; text-align: left"&gt;払込金総額　　72,927千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;割当先　野村證券株式会社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
